1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Ni kuhusu Urithi wa Dunia wa Japani.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Urithi wa Dunia Mpya wa Nara / Maeneo Mapya ya Urithi wa Dunia ya Nara

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:15,041
Eeh, angalia habari za televisheni.

4
00:00:15,064 --> 00:00:17,630
Habari za nini?

5
00:00:17,653 --> 00:00:20,387
Habari za Nara.

6
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:25,776
Asuka na Fujiwara zimekuwa Urithi wa Dunia mpya.

7
00:00:25,799 --> 00:00:27,735
Kweli?

8
00:00:27,759 --> 00:00:30,559
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

9
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:35,182
Ndiyo. Nimefurahi sana.

10
00:00:35,205 --> 00:00:40,038
Nara ina maeneo mengi ya Urithi wa Dunia, sivyo?

11
00:00:40,061 --> 00:00:43,346
Sasa ziko ngapi?

12
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:47,906
Ee, kwa sasa ziko tatu.

13
00:00:47,929 --> 00:00:49,963
Tatu?

14
00:00:49,987 --> 00:00:51,801
Ziko wapi?

15
00:00:51,824 --> 00:00:55,258
Moja ni Horyu-ji.

16
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:59,414
Ni hekalu la mbao lililo kongwe zaidi nchini Japani.

17
00:00:59,438 --> 00:01:01,485
Ndiyo?

18
00:01:01,509 --> 00:01:04,942
Nimeona kwenye televisheni pia.

19
00:01:04,965 --> 00:01:09,622
Pili ni mji wa Nara, ikiwa ni pamoja na Todai-ji.

20
00:01:09,646 --> 00:01:13,379
Kuna Buddha kubwa, sivyo?

21
00:01:13,402 --> 00:01:17,936
Pia kuna punda milia wengi kwenye bustani.

22
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:22,759
Ndiyo. Ya tatu ni milima ya Yoshino kusini.

23
00:01:22,782 --> 00:01:24,916
Yoshino?

24
00:01:24,939 --> 00:01:28,578
Msimu wa machipuko, maua ya sakura ni ya kuvutia sana, sivyo?

25
00:01:28,601 --> 00:01:31,268
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

26
00:01:31,291 --> 00:01:37,024
Na sasa, Asuka na Fujiwara zimeongeza kuwa nne.

27
00:01:37,047 --> 00:01:40,465
Je, ni mengi zaidi nchini Japani?

28
00:01:40,489 --> 00:01:45,622
Ndiyo. Nara ni mahali pa ajabu sana.

29
00:01:45,645 --> 00:01:47,378
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

30
00:01:47,401 --> 00:01:50,858
Kuna historia nyingi za kale.

31
00:01:50,882 --> 00:01:55,515
Asuka ilikuwa mji mkubwa wa kwanza nchini Japani.

32
00:01:55,538 --> 00:01:59,636
Sasa kuna nini Asuka?

33
00:01:59,659 --> 00:02:03,510
Kuna mahekalu ya kale sana na makaburi ya kale.

34
00:02:03,534 --> 00:02:05,872
Makaburi ya kale?

35
00:02:05,895 --> 00:02:07,946
Yale ni nini?

36
00:02:07,969 --> 00:02:12,569
Ni makaburi ya wafalme wa zamani na watu mashuhuri.

37
00:02:12,592 --> 00:02:15,886
Haya, ni ya kuvutia!

38
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:18,244
Yana umbo gani?

39
00:02:18,267 --> 00:02:22,351
Yalijengwa kwa mawe makubwa sana.

40
00:02:22,374 --> 00:02:26,431
Je, unaweza kuingia ndani?

41
00:02:26,455 --> 00:02:31,889
Hapana. Lakini unaweza kuona picha kwenye kuta karibu.

42
00:02:31,913 --> 00:02:35,368
Ninapenda sana kuona picha hizo.

43
00:02:35,391 --> 00:02:39,726
Je, tusipite pamoja wikendi ijayo?

44
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:41,950
Sawa!

45
00:02:41,973 --> 00:02:44,181
Tunapaswa kwenda.

46
00:02:44,204 --> 00:02:47,771
Tutakwenda kwa treni kutoka Osaka?

47
00:02:47,794 --> 00:02:51,327
Ndiyo, tutumie treni ya Kintetsu.

48
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:56,717
Asuka ni eneo pana, hivyo tutaweza kukodisha baiskeli kwenye kituo cha treni.

49
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:58,706
Sawa.

50
00:02:58,729 --> 00:03:01,898
Kuna migahawa inayopika vyakula vizuri?

51
00:03:01,922 --> 00:03:07,088
Ndiyo. Tukale sushi ya majani ya persimoni maarufu ya Nara.

52
00:03:07,111 --> 00:03:11,160
Natumai safari ya mwishoni mwa wiki itakuwa ya furaha sana.

53
00:03:11,184 --> 00:03:20,193
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

54
00:03:20,193 --> 00:03:21,693
Sehemu ya 2: Utalii wa Nara: Ziara ya Hekalu la Tōdai-ji

55
00:03:21,693 --> 00:03:24,526
Tumefika Nara.

56
00:03:24,549 --> 00:03:27,916
Ndiyo, hali ya hewa ni nzuri sana.

57
00:03:27,939 --> 00:03:31,272
Kwanza, tutaenda wapi?

58
00:03:31,295 --> 00:03:34,332
Tukaeende Hekalu la Tōdai-ji.

59
00:03:34,356 --> 00:03:36,806
Tutakwenda kwa miguu?

60
00:03:36,829 --> 00:03:38,429
Ndiyo.

61
00:03:38,452 --> 00:03:42,827
Ni dakika kama kumi na tano kutoka kituo cha treni.

62
00:03:42,851 --> 00:03:44,851
Sawa.

63
00:03:44,874 --> 00:03:46,685
Twende.

64
00:03:46,709 --> 00:03:49,384
Kuna watu wengi sana hapa.

65
00:03:49,407 --> 00:03:51,141
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

66
00:03:51,164 --> 00:03:54,170
Wageni kutoka nje ya nchi pia wako wengi.

67
00:03:54,193 --> 00:03:57,160
Huko ndipo Hekalu la Tōdai-ji.

68
00:03:57,183 --> 00:04:01,616
Eeh, jengo hili ni kubwa sana!

69
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:05,119
Ndiyo, twende ndani.

70
00:04:05,143 --> 00:04:08,076
Mimi nitanunua tiketi.

71
00:04:08,099 --> 00:04:10,102
Asante sana.

72
00:04:10,125 --> 00:04:13,959
Tazama, hii ndiyo Buddha kubwa.

73
00:04:13,982 --> 00:04:17,915
Eeh, ni kubwa kweli!

74
00:04:17,938 --> 00:04:21,871
Ndiyo, ni refu sana.

75
00:04:21,894 --> 00:04:24,970
Ina urefu wa mita kama kumi na tano.

76
00:04:24,994 --> 00:04:27,204
Ina ajabu!

77
00:04:27,227 --> 00:04:29,806
Tuchukue picha.

78
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:32,398
Ndiyo, nitachukua.

79
00:04:32,421 --> 00:04:35,105
Cheka kidogo.

80
00:04:35,129 --> 00:04:37,129
Asante sana.

81
00:04:37,152 --> 00:04:41,442
Sasa tutatembea ndani ya bustani.

82
00:04:41,465 --> 00:04:43,907
Ndiyo, ni vizuri.

83
00:04:43,930 --> 00:04:46,419
Tazama huko.

84
00:04:46,443 --> 00:04:51,576
Eeh, kuna swala wengi sana bustanini!

85
00:04:51,599 --> 00:04:53,895
Wana mvuto sana!

86
00:04:53,919 --> 00:04:57,492
Ninataka kuwapa swala chakula.

87
00:04:57,516 --> 00:05:01,360
Basi, tununue biskuti za swala.

88
00:05:01,383 --> 00:05:03,717
Biskuti za swala?

89
00:05:03,739 --> 00:05:08,078
Ndiyo, ni chakula maalum kwa ajili ya swala.

90
00:05:08,102 --> 00:05:10,568
Nimenunua moja.

91
00:05:10,591 --> 00:05:12,958
Swala wamekuja!

92
00:05:12,981 --> 00:05:17,049
Ndiyo, chukua, nitawapa biskuti.

93
00:05:17,073 --> 00:05:19,473
Wana kula vizuri sana.

94
00:05:19,496 --> 00:05:22,463
Wana mvuto sana.

95
00:05:22,486 --> 00:05:25,784
Je, utawapa swala biskuti zaidi?

96
00:05:25,808 --> 00:05:29,075
Ndiyo, nitanunua nyingine.

97
00:05:29,098 --> 00:05:32,031
Swala wanafurahi sana.

98
00:05:32,054 --> 00:05:35,790
Safari ya Nara imekuwa ya furaha sana.

99
00:05:35,813 --> 00:05:38,413
Hiyo ni nzuri.

100
00:05:38,436 --> 00:05:45,541
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

101
00:05:45,541 --> 00:05:47,041
Sehemu ya 3: Hekalu la Hōryū-ji: Muundo wa Mbao wa Kale Zaidi Ulimwenguni

102
00:05:47,041 --> 00:05:50,658
Tumefika Hekalu la Hōryū-ji.

103
00:05:50,681 --> 00:05:53,926
Ni mahali pa kimya sana.

104
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:59,317
Ndiyo. Kuna majengo mengi ya kale.

105
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:03,793
Huu hekalu ulijengwa lini?

106
00:06:03,817 --> 00:06:07,017
Ni wakati wa Asuka.

107
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,720
Ni zamani sana.

108
00:06:09,743 --> 00:06:15,143
Aha, ni zamani mno.

109
00:06:15,166 --> 00:06:21,900
Ndiyo. Ni jengo la mbao lililo kongwe zaidi nchini Japani.

110
00:06:21,923 --> 00:06:26,356
Ni kongwe zaidi nchini Japani?

111
00:06:26,379 --> 00:06:31,984
Ndiyo. Ni jengo la mbao lililo kongwe zaidi duniani pia.

112
00:06:32,008 --> 00:06:37,894
Kongwe duniani? Hiyo ni ajabu sana!

113
00:06:37,918 --> 00:06:43,051
Ee. Kwa sababu hiyo, limekuwa Urithi wa Dunia.

114
00:06:43,074 --> 00:06:46,413
Hebu tuingie ndani ya jengo.

115
00:06:46,437 --> 00:06:50,651
Sawa. Hiyo ndiyo ingilio.

116
00:06:50,674 --> 00:06:53,007
Nimeununua tiketi.

117
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:54,797
Twende.

118
00:06:54,820 --> 00:07:01,440
Tazama. Jengo lile ni pagoda yenye ngazi tano.

119
00:07:01,463 --> 00:07:05,996
Ni refu sana. Na nzuri pia.

120
00:07:06,019 --> 00:07:10,157
Ndiyo. Ni nzuri mno.

121
00:07:10,181 --> 00:07:13,756
Naweza kupiga picha hapa?

122
00:07:13,779 --> 00:07:17,512
Nje ya jengo, unaweza kupiga picha.

123
00:07:17,535 --> 00:07:21,302
Sawa sana. Hebu tupige pamoja.

124
00:07:21,325 --> 00:07:25,599
Ndiyo. Mimi nitashika kamera.

125
00:07:25,622 --> 00:07:27,389
Asante sana.

126
00:07:27,412 --> 00:07:33,312
Tuko tayari. Cheese!

127
00:07:33,335 --> 00:07:36,968
Picha nzuri! Ninafurahi.

128
00:07:36,991 --> 00:07:41,391
Sasa tutazame jengo lile upande mwingine.

129
00:07:41,414 --> 00:07:45,666
Sawa. Kuna nini ndani ya lile jengo?

130
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:48,566
Kuna sanamu za kale za Buddha.

131
00:07:48,589 --> 00:07:52,272
Naweza kupiga picha za sanamu hizo?

132
00:07:52,296 --> 00:07:58,029
Hapana, huwezi kupiga picha ndani ya jengo.

133
00:07:58,052 --> 00:08:01,734
Nimeelewa. Nitakuwa makini.

134
00:08:01,758 --> 00:08:03,892
Tutazame polepole.

135
00:08:03,915 --> 00:08:09,281
Sanamu hii ina uso mpole sana.

136
00:08:09,304 --> 00:08:13,438
Ndiyo. Mimi pia nafikiri hivyo.

137
00:08:13,461 --> 00:08:17,394
Hōryū-ji ni mahali pazuri sana.

138
00:08:17,417 --> 00:08:19,750
Nimefurahi tulikuja.

139
00:08:19,773 --> 00:08:23,907
Ndiyo. Nimejifunza mengi kuhusu historia.

140
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:28,302
Sasa twende tuangalie zawadi?

141
00:08:28,325 --> 00:08:31,692
Sawa. Twende.

142
00:08:31,715 --> 00:08:33,215
Sehemu ya 4: Kuona Mlima Fuji kutoka kwenye treni ya Shinkansen

143
00:08:33,215 --> 00:08:36,548
Treni ya Shinkansen ni haraka sana, sivyo?

144
00:08:36,571 --> 00:08:40,012
Ndiyo. Ni haraka mno.

145
00:08:40,036 --> 00:08:42,503
Aa, angalia huko!

146
00:08:42,526 --> 00:08:46,221
Unaona mlima mkubwa kupitia dirisha.

147
00:08:46,244 --> 00:08:48,244
Ni kweli!

148
00:08:48,267 --> 00:08:51,338
Je, ni Mlima Fuji?

149
00:08:51,362 --> 00:08:54,129
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

150
00:08:54,152 --> 00:08:57,728
Ni mlima mashuhuri zaidi nchini Japani.

151
00:08:57,751 --> 00:09:00,996
Waa, ni mzuri mno!

152
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:03,698
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri.

153
00:09:03,721 --> 00:09:06,921
Kwa hivyo, unaona vizuri.

154
00:09:06,944 --> 00:09:10,078
Sehemu ya juu ya mlima ni nyeupe.

155
00:09:10,101 --> 00:09:13,581
Ndiyo. Kuna theluji.

156
00:09:13,604 --> 00:09:17,604
Ninataka kupiga picha ya Mlima Fuji.

157
00:09:17,627 --> 00:09:19,260
Sawa!

158
00:09:19,283 --> 00:09:21,898
Ndiyo, nimepiga picha.

159
00:09:21,922 --> 00:09:24,098
Picha nzuri sana.

160
00:09:24,122 --> 00:09:28,659
Mlima Fuji ni mlima mrefu zaidi nchini Japani.

161
00:09:28,682 --> 00:09:31,148
Una urefu wa kiasi gani?

162
00:09:31,171 --> 00:09:34,505
Unakaribia mita 3,700.

163
00:09:34,528 --> 00:09:37,012
Ni mrefu sana!

164
00:09:37,035 --> 00:09:39,924
Je, unaweza kupanda?

165
00:09:39,948 --> 00:09:44,187
Ndiyo. Wakati wa kiangazi, watu wengi hupanda.

166
00:09:44,210 --> 00:09:49,377
Ndiyo hivo? Mimi pia natamani nipande siku moja.

167
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,833
Unataka kupanda Mlima Fuji?

168
00:09:51,856 --> 00:09:55,943
Ndiyo. Nataka kufika juu kabisa.

169
00:09:55,966 --> 00:10:00,065
Mandhari kutoka juu ni nzuri sana.

170
00:10:00,088 --> 00:10:02,337
Natumai niione mapema.

171
00:10:02,361 --> 00:10:05,330
Hakika itakuwa kumbukumbu nzuri.

172
00:10:05,354 --> 00:10:08,836
Lakini, je, kupanda ni vigumu?

173
00:10:08,859 --> 00:10:14,225
Ndiyo. Hutembea kwa umbali mrefu, kwa hiyo unachoka sana.

174
00:10:14,248 --> 00:10:18,015
Basi, inahitaji mazoezi mengi.

175
00:10:18,038 --> 00:10:22,608
Ndiyo. Viatu vya mlima pia ni muhimu.

176
00:10:22,631 --> 00:10:26,231
Nataka kununua viatu vya mlima.

177
00:10:26,254 --> 00:10:30,458
Sawa! Twende kununua pamoja.

178
00:10:30,482 --> 00:10:32,082
Asante sana.

179
00:10:32,105 --> 00:10:36,959
Karibu na Mlima Fuji kuna maziwa mazuri pia.

180
00:10:36,983 --> 00:10:39,075
Maziwa?

181
00:10:39,099 --> 00:10:43,665
Ndiyo. Mlima Fuji unaonekana vizuri kutoka huko.

182
00:10:43,688 --> 00:10:47,122
Basi, nataka kwenda maziwani pia.

183
00:10:47,145 --> 00:10:50,811
Safari yetu ijayo, twende huko.

184
00:10:50,834 --> 00:10:54,168
Ndiyo. Ninasubiri kwa hamu.

185
00:10:54,191 --> 00:10:55,691
Sehemu ya 5: Twende Kwenye Hekalu la Dhahabu Kinkaku-ji

186
00:10:55,691 --> 00:10:58,630
Tumefika Kyoto.

187
00:10:58,653 --> 00:11:01,920
Ndiyo. Treni ilikuwa haraka sana.

188
00:11:01,943 --> 00:11:05,743
Hapa pia kuna watu wengi.

189
00:11:05,766 --> 00:11:08,333
Ni mahali penye shughuli nyingi.

190
00:11:08,356 --> 00:11:11,189
Sasa tutaenda wapi?

191
00:11:11,212 --> 00:11:13,979
Twende Kinkaku-ji.

192
00:11:14,002 --> 00:11:16,403
Kinkaku-ji?

193
00:11:16,426 --> 00:11:18,865
Ni hekalu la aina gani?

194
00:11:18,888 --> 00:11:22,855
Ni hekalu la dhahabu, zuri sana.

195
00:11:22,878 --> 00:11:25,211
La dhahabu?

196
00:11:25,234 --> 00:11:27,887
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

197
00:11:27,911 --> 00:11:31,278
Ndiyo. Twende kwa basi.

198
00:11:31,301 --> 00:11:34,787
Basi itachukua muda gani?

199
00:11:34,810 --> 00:11:37,589
Itachukua dakika thelathini hivi.

200
00:11:37,613 --> 00:11:39,646
Sawa.

201
00:11:39,669 --> 00:11:42,236
Tumefika Kinkaku-ji.

202
00:11:42,259 --> 00:11:44,459
Tuingie ndani.

203
00:11:44,481 --> 00:11:46,885
Ninunue tiketi.

204
00:11:46,909 --> 00:11:48,548
Asante sana.

205
00:11:48,571 --> 00:11:50,654
Tazama huko.

206
00:11:50,678 --> 00:11:53,745
Kuna jengo pale.

207
00:11:53,768 --> 00:11:58,102
Eeh! Kweli ni la dhahabu!

208
00:11:58,125 --> 00:12:01,599
Ndiyo. Ni zuri sana.

209
00:12:01,622 --> 00:12:04,989
Hata kwenye maji unaona hekalu.

210
00:12:05,012 --> 00:12:07,869
Kuna bwawa kubwa.

211
00:12:07,892 --> 00:12:11,226
Tupige picha hapa.

212
00:12:11,249 --> 00:12:14,496
Ndiyo. Nitakupiga picha.

213
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,093
Tafadhali.

214
00:12:16,116 --> 00:12:19,567
Eneo la hekalu hilo Kinkaku-ji limezungukwa na mandhari nzuri.

215
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:22,223
Kuna miti mingi hapa, sivyo?

216
00:12:22,246 --> 00:12:24,380
Tuvuke kidogo.

217
00:12:24,403 --> 00:12:27,500
Kule kuna duka la zawadi.

218
00:12:27,523 --> 00:12:29,594
Twende tuione.

219
00:12:29,618 --> 00:12:31,818
Unataka kununua nini?

220
00:12:31,841 --> 00:12:35,218
Ninataka kununua vivi.

221
00:12:35,241 --> 00:12:38,208
Katika Kyoto, vivi ni tamu sana.

222
00:12:38,231 --> 00:12:40,900
Kuna biskuti za matcha.

223
00:12:40,924 --> 00:12:42,924
Inaonekana tamu, sivyo?

224
00:12:42,947 --> 00:12:45,818
Nitainunua hii kwa ajili ya rafiki yangu.

225
00:12:45,842 --> 00:12:48,875
Mimi ninataka kununua chai.

226
00:12:48,898 --> 00:12:50,468
Sawa!

227
00:12:50,492 --> 00:12:54,059
Usiku huu, tusikunywe chai pamoja katika hoteli.

228
00:12:54,082 --> 00:12:56,940
Ndiyo. Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

229
00:12:56,963 --> 00:12:58,463
Sehemu ya 6: Safari ya Miyajima na Hekalu la Itsukushima

230
00:12:58,463 --> 00:13:01,630
Tumefika Hiroshima.

231
00:13:01,653 --> 00:13:04,393
Sasa tutaenda wapi?

232
00:13:04,416 --> 00:13:07,869
Twende kwenye bandari ya feri.

233
00:13:07,892 --> 00:13:11,359
Tutakwenda Miyajima kwa feri.

234
00:13:11,382 --> 00:13:14,188
Tutachukua muda gani?

235
00:13:14,212 --> 00:13:16,145
Je, ni mbali?

236
00:13:16,168 --> 00:13:19,218
Kama dakika kumi na tano hivi.

237
00:13:19,242 --> 00:13:22,842
Ni karibu, tutafika haraka.

238
00:13:22,865 --> 00:13:26,198
Kupanda meli ni furaha, sivyo?

239
00:13:26,221 --> 00:13:29,589
Upepo wa bahari unapendeza.

240
00:13:29,613 --> 00:13:32,946
Ndiyo, leo hii hali ya hewa ni nzuri sana.

241
00:13:32,969 --> 00:13:36,169
Aa, angalia huko!

242
00:13:36,192 --> 00:13:40,826
Kuna kitu kikubwa cha nyekundu ndani ya bahari.

243
00:13:40,849 --> 00:13:43,849
Hicho ni torii.

244
00:13:43,872 --> 00:13:47,605
Torii ya Hekalu la Itsukushima.

245
00:13:47,628 --> 00:13:50,037
Torii?

246
00:13:50,061 --> 00:13:53,907
Hekalu liko ndani ya bahari?

247
00:13:53,930 --> 00:13:55,864
Ndiyo.

248
00:13:55,887 --> 00:13:59,620
Hicho hekalu liko ndani ya bahari.

249
00:13:59,643 --> 00:14:02,695
Hiyo ni ajabu sana.

250
00:14:02,718 --> 00:14:06,052
Tutapitaje ndani?

251
00:14:06,074 --> 00:14:14,085
Majengo ya hekalu pia yako juu ya bahari, hivyo tutaingia kwa kutembea kwenye daraja.

252
00:14:14,109 --> 00:14:17,206
Je, tunaweza kwenda karibu na torii?

253
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:21,263
Sasa hivi ni ndani ya bahari, hivyo hatuwezi kwenda.

254
00:14:21,286 --> 00:14:25,983
Lakini jioni tutaweza kwenda kwa kutembea.

255
00:14:26,007 --> 00:14:29,880
Eeh, tutatembea?

256
00:14:29,903 --> 00:14:31,970
Kwa nini?

257
00:14:31,993 --> 00:14:36,531
Jioni maji ya bahari hupungua.

258
00:14:36,555 --> 00:14:40,053
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kutembea.

259
00:14:40,076 --> 00:14:43,486
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

260
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:47,723
Jioni twende tukitembea karibu nayo.

261
00:14:47,746 --> 00:14:50,325
Ndiyo, twende.

262
00:14:50,349 --> 00:14:54,244
Aa, tumefika Miyajima!

263
00:14:54,267 --> 00:14:57,403
Kuna watu wengi sana hapa.

264
00:14:57,427 --> 00:15:01,040
Aa, hapa pia kuna pundamilia.

265
00:15:01,063 --> 00:15:03,270
Ni kweli!

266
00:15:03,293 --> 00:15:07,027
Kama Nara, kuna pundamilia wengi.

267
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:10,549
Ninataka kuwapatia pundamilia biskuti.

268
00:15:10,572 --> 00:15:12,645
Je, naweza kununua?

269
00:15:12,669 --> 00:15:18,546
Hapa usimlishane wanyama.

270
00:15:18,569 --> 00:15:20,069
Sehemu ya 7: Ngome ya Himeji na Ngome ya Shirasagi / Himeji Castle and Shirasagi Castle

271
00:15:20,069 --> 00:15:23,349
Tumefika Himeji.

272
00:15:23,372 --> 00:15:26,938
Hiyo ndiyo Ngome ya Himeji, sivyo?

273
00:15:26,961 --> 00:15:31,233
Waa, ngome hii ni kubwa sana!

274
00:15:31,257 --> 00:15:34,947
Na ni nyeupe sana pia.

275
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:39,063
Ndio. Nyeupe na nzuri.

276
00:15:39,087 --> 00:15:43,620
Ngome hii ina jina maalum.

277
00:15:43,643 --> 00:15:46,876
Jina maalum?

278
00:15:46,899 --> 00:15:48,699
Ni nini?

279
00:15:48,722 --> 00:15:52,008
Inaitwa Ngome ya Shirasagi.

280
00:15:52,032 --> 00:15:54,710
Shirasagi?

281
00:15:54,733 --> 00:15:57,169
Yale ni nini?

282
00:15:57,193 --> 00:16:00,860
Ni jina la ndege mweupe.

283
00:16:00,883 --> 00:16:03,899
Ngome ya ndege mweupe?

284
00:16:03,922 --> 00:16:06,489
Jina zuri sana!

285
00:16:06,512 --> 00:16:10,845
Sasa, tumingie ndani ya ngome.

286
00:16:10,868 --> 00:16:13,725
Ndio, twende.

287
00:16:13,749 --> 00:16:17,316
Tafadhali vua viatu hapa.

288
00:16:17,339 --> 00:16:19,272
Sawa.

289
00:16:19,295 --> 00:16:22,695
Tutakwenda juu kutoka hapa.

290
00:16:22,718 --> 00:16:26,537
Kuna ngazi nyingi, sivyo?

291
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:30,760
Ndio. Haya sawa.

292
00:16:30,783 --> 00:16:32,633
Asante sana.

293
00:16:32,657 --> 00:16:36,190
Bado kuna sehemu za juu zaidi.

294
00:16:36,213 --> 00:16:40,180
Eeh, nimechoka kidogo.

295
00:16:40,203 --> 00:16:42,446
Unaendelea vizuri?

296
00:16:42,469 --> 00:16:47,103
Ndio. Lakini ngazi ni ndefu.

297
00:16:47,126 --> 00:16:53,092
Ni jengo la zamani, hakuna lifti.

298
00:16:53,115 --> 00:16:57,315
Ndio. Twende polepole.

299
00:16:57,338 --> 00:17:02,272
Tuko karibu na juu kabisa.

300
00:17:02,295 --> 00:17:04,108
Nitapigika.

301
00:17:04,131 --> 00:17:06,221
Tumefika.

302
00:17:06,245 --> 00:17:09,521
Hii ndiyo sehemu ya juu kabisa.

303
00:17:09,545 --> 00:17:12,145
Tazama nje.

304
00:17:12,168 --> 00:17:15,340
Mambo, mandhari nzuri sana!

305
00:17:15,363 --> 00:17:20,096
Unaweza kuona mji wote wa Himeji.

306
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:23,553
Upepo pia unaonekana mzuri.

307
00:17:23,576 --> 00:17:26,948
Bado una uchovu?

308
00:17:26,972 --> 00:17:32,629
Hapana, baada ya kuona mandhari hii, nimerudi nguvu.

309
00:17:32,653 --> 00:17:36,058
Hiyo ni nzuri.

310
00:17:36,081 --> 00:17:38,817
Tupige picha hapa.

311
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,929
Sawa!

312
00:17:40,953 --> 00:17:44,120
Simama karibu na dirisha.

313
00:17:44,143 --> 00:17:46,478
Sawa. Tafadhali.

314
00:17:46,501 --> 00:17:48,710
Nitakupiga picha.

315
00:17:48,734 --> 00:17:52,135
Sawa, cheeez!

316
00:17:52,159 --> 00:17:54,092
Asante sana.

317
00:17:54,115 --> 00:17:56,848
Picha nzuri sana.

318
00:17:56,871 --> 00:17:58,371
Sehemu ya 8: Shirakawa-go na Nyumba za Gassho / Shirakawa-go and Gassho-style Houses

319
00:17:58,371 --> 00:18:02,005
Unaangalia picha gani?

320
00:18:02,028 --> 00:18:05,594
Hii ni picha ya Shirakawa-go katika Gifu.

321
00:18:05,617 --> 00:18:09,472
Waa, theluji nyingi!

322
00:18:09,496 --> 00:18:14,462
Ndio. Wakati wa baridi, theluji nyingi hunyesha.

323
00:18:14,485 --> 00:18:17,290
Kijiji hiki ni cha kupendeza sana!

324
00:18:17,314 --> 00:18:22,281
Ndio. Hii pia ni Urithi wa Dunia wa Japani.

325
00:18:22,304 --> 00:18:25,737
Shirakawa-go ni mahali kama gani?

326
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:29,760
Ni kijiji cha zamani kilichopo ndani ya milima.

327
00:18:29,783 --> 00:18:33,583
Nyumba hii ina paa kubwa sana, sivyo?

328
00:18:33,606 --> 00:18:38,292
Ndiyo. Hii inaitwa 'Gasshō-zukuri'.

329
00:18:38,315 --> 00:18:42,482
'Gasshō-zukuri'? Inamaanisha nini?

330
00:18:42,505 --> 00:18:45,372
Ni umbo la mikono iliyounganishwa katika sala.

331
00:18:45,395 --> 00:18:47,761
Ina kichwa cha kupendeza!

332
00:18:47,784 --> 00:18:50,992
Kwa nini umbo hili?

333
00:18:51,016 --> 00:18:55,583
Kwa sababu theluji hunyesha sana, ndiyo sababu ya umbo hili.

334
00:18:55,606 --> 00:19:00,073
Nimeelewa. Theluji huporomoka kwa urahisi.

335
00:19:00,096 --> 00:19:03,929
Ee, ni hekima ya watu wa zamani.

336
00:19:03,952 --> 00:19:08,386
Nyumba hii iliundwa na nani?

337
00:19:08,409 --> 00:19:11,895
Watu wa zamani walijenga pamoja.

338
00:19:11,918 --> 00:19:14,005
Ina ajabu!

339
00:19:14,028 --> 00:19:16,994
Je, watu bado wanakaa humu?

340
00:19:17,017 --> 00:19:21,184
Ndiyo, watu wengi bado wanakaa na kuishi humu.

341
00:19:21,207 --> 00:19:24,574
Je, tunaweza kuingia ndani ya nyumba?

342
00:19:24,597 --> 00:19:28,936
Ndiyo, kuna nyumba zinazoruhusu kuingia ndani.

343
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,893
Ndani ni vipi?

344
00:19:31,916 --> 00:19:34,729
Kuna zana za kale.

345
00:19:34,753 --> 00:19:36,886
Ni pana sana!

346
00:19:36,909 --> 00:19:39,717
Hii ni ya kustaajabisha!

347
00:19:39,741 --> 00:19:43,776
Wakati wa majira ya baridi, usiku nyumba hizi huwa zimeangaziwa taa.

348
00:19:43,799 --> 00:19:46,168
Zimeangaziwa taa?

349
00:19:46,192 --> 00:19:50,592
Ndiyo, mwanga wa nyumba unaonekana mzuri sana.

350
00:19:50,615 --> 00:19:52,949
Ni ya kimapenzi!

351
00:19:52,972 --> 00:19:56,055
Je, una picha za hizo?

352
00:19:56,078 --> 00:19:58,844
Tazama, hii ndiyo picha.

353
00:19:58,867 --> 00:20:01,506
Ni nzuri kweli kweli!

354
00:20:01,530 --> 00:20:04,297
Ninapenda kwenda huko pia.

355
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:07,754
Basi, siku moja tutaenda pamoja.

356
00:20:07,777 --> 00:20:09,944
Lini ni wakati mwema?

357
00:20:09,967 --> 00:20:12,600
Wakati wa majira ya baridi ni bora.

358
00:20:12,623 --> 00:20:15,257
Lakini ni baridi sana.

359
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:18,752
Basi, ni nguo zipi zinazofaa?

360
00:20:18,775 --> 00:20:22,671
Unahitaji koti nzito na buti.

361
00:20:22,695 --> 00:20:24,301
Sawa.

362
00:20:24,325 --> 00:20:27,491
Kuna vyakula vizuri vya kula?

363
00:20:27,514 --> 00:20:30,181
Nyama ya 'Hida Gyu' ni maarufu.

364
00:20:30,205 --> 00:20:32,498
Ni nyama ya ng'ombe yenye ladha nzuri.

365
00:20:32,521 --> 00:20:34,293
Sawa!

366
00:20:34,317 --> 00:20:37,009
Ninataka kwenda mapema!

367
00:20:37,032 --> 00:20:39,266
Tunangojea kwa hamu!

368
00:20:39,289 --> 00:20:40,789
Sehemu ya 9: Safari ya Yakushima

369
00:20:40,789 --> 00:20:45,226
Je, unataka kwenda wapi safari ijayo?

370
00:20:45,249 --> 00:20:50,900
Ninapenda kwenda Yakushima huko Kagoshima.

371
00:20:50,924 --> 00:20:53,291
Yakushima?

372
00:20:53,314 --> 00:20:56,047
Ni mahali kama vipi?

373
00:20:56,070 --> 00:21:00,803
Ni kisiwa chenye bahari na milima mizuri sana.

374
00:21:00,826 --> 00:21:04,160
Hii pia ni Urithi wa Dunia, sivyo?

375
00:21:04,183 --> 00:21:09,183
Ndiyo, asili yake ni ya ajabu sana.

376
00:21:09,206 --> 00:21:13,062
Umewahi kwenda Yakushima?

377
00:21:13,085 --> 00:21:16,574
Hapana, sijawahi.

378
00:21:16,597 --> 00:21:20,597
Kwa hiyo, ninataka kwenda siku moja.

379
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:24,100
Kuna nini Yakushima?

380
00:21:24,124 --> 00:21:28,741
Kuna mti mkubwa na wa zamani sana.

381
00:21:28,764 --> 00:21:31,611
Mti mkubwa?

382
00:21:31,635 --> 00:21:36,251
Ndiyo. Ni mti maarufu wa misugi.

383
00:21:36,274 --> 00:21:39,074
Umeishi kwa muda gani?

384
00:21:39,097 --> 00:21:42,747
Ni mti wa miaka elfu kadhaa.

385
00:21:42,770 --> 00:21:45,945
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

386
00:21:45,969 --> 00:21:49,176
Ningependa kuuona pia.

387
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:54,233
Lakini, ni safari ndefu hadi mti.

388
00:21:54,256 --> 00:21:56,789
Unahitaji kutembea kwa muda gani?

389
00:21:56,812 --> 00:22:00,979
Kutembea kwa takriban saa kumi kupanda mlima.

390
00:22:01,002 --> 00:22:04,813
Eeh, saa kumi?

391
00:22:04,836 --> 00:22:07,870
Ni safari ngumu sana.

392
00:22:07,893 --> 00:22:13,326
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, maandalizi ni muhimu.

393
00:22:13,349 --> 00:22:16,433
Ni maandalizi gani yanayohitajika?

394
00:22:16,456 --> 00:22:21,467
Kwanza, unahitaji viatu vinavyofaa kwa kutembea.

395
00:22:21,490 --> 00:22:24,124
Viatu vya mlima, ndiyo?

396
00:22:24,147 --> 00:22:26,480
Sawa.

397
00:22:26,503 --> 00:22:30,382
Pia, unahitaji nguo za mvua.

398
00:22:30,406 --> 00:22:32,872
Koti la mvua, ndiyo?

399
00:22:32,895 --> 00:22:35,262
Kwa nini?

400
00:22:35,285 --> 00:22:40,095
Kisiwa cha Yakushima kunanyesha sana.

401
00:22:40,118 --> 00:22:42,958
Kuna mvua mara kwa mara?

402
00:22:42,982 --> 00:22:50,037
Ndiyo. Husemwa kunyesha siku 35 kwa mwezi mmoja.

403
00:22:50,061 --> 00:22:53,227
Hii ni ya kustaajabisha!

404
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:56,227
Kunyesha sana kweli.

405
00:22:56,251 --> 00:23:02,510
Mwavuli hautumiki kwa sababu hauwezi kutumia mikono, ni hatari mlima.

406
00:23:02,533 --> 00:23:04,100
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

407
00:23:04,123 --> 00:23:07,856
Basi, nitanunua nguo za mvua.

408
00:23:07,879 --> 00:23:12,112
Siku ya pumziko, twende kununua pamoja.

409
00:23:12,135 --> 00:23:14,302
Asante sana.

410
00:23:14,325 --> 00:23:17,820
Siku moja tutaenda pamoja.

411
00:23:17,843 --> 00:23:19,610
Ndiyo.

412
00:23:19,633 --> 00:23:22,803
Kuanzia sasa nitazunguka sana.

413
00:23:22,827 --> 00:23:25,261
Tukashirikiane.

414
00:23:25,284 --> 00:23:26,784
Sehemu ya 10: Asili ya Urithi wa Dunia wa Shiretoko

415
00:23:26,784 --> 00:23:29,673
Tazama televisheni.

416
00:23:29,697 --> 00:23:33,772
Kuna programu kuhusu Hokkaido.

417
00:23:33,796 --> 00:23:38,929
Eeh, bahari na milima ni nzuri sana!

418
00:23:38,952 --> 00:23:43,352
Ndiyo. Hapa ni Shiretoko.

419
00:23:43,375 --> 00:23:46,775
Ni Urithi wa Dunia wa Japani.

420
00:23:46,798 --> 00:23:49,131
Shiretoko?

421
00:23:49,154 --> 00:23:52,688
Kuna asili nyingi hapa.

422
00:23:52,711 --> 00:23:54,487
Ndiyo.

423
00:23:54,510 --> 00:23:57,076
Aa, angalia huko!

424
00:23:57,099 --> 00:23:59,068
Kuna dubu.

425
00:23:59,092 --> 00:24:01,170
Ni kweli!

426
00:24:01,194 --> 00:24:03,827
Ni mkubwa sana.

427
00:24:03,850 --> 00:24:07,590
Dubu hula samaki wa mto.

428
00:24:07,613 --> 00:24:10,909
Kuna samaki wengi mtoni.

429
00:24:10,932 --> 00:24:12,665
Ndiyo.

430
00:24:12,688 --> 00:24:15,865
Sasa kuna mbweha.

431
00:24:15,889 --> 00:24:18,108
Ni mzuri!

432
00:24:18,131 --> 00:24:21,198
Je, kuna mbweha wengi?

433
00:24:21,221 --> 00:24:22,821
Ndiyo.

434
00:24:22,844 --> 00:24:25,711
Kuna wengi katika milimani.

435
00:24:25,734 --> 00:24:28,903
Ndege pia wanapanda angani.

436
00:24:28,926 --> 00:24:32,800
Shiretoko kuna wanyama wengi.

437
00:24:32,823 --> 00:24:35,990
Ni mahali pazuri sana.

438
00:24:36,013 --> 00:24:41,246
Napenda wanyama sana. Mimi pia napenda.

439
00:24:41,269 --> 00:24:44,039
Shiretoko wakati wa baridi ni vipi?

440
00:24:44,063 --> 00:24:47,359
Wakati wa baridi kunanyesha theluji sana.

441
00:24:47,382 --> 00:24:50,149
Ni baridi mno.

442
00:24:50,172 --> 00:24:52,544
Bahari itakuwa vipi?

443
00:24:52,568 --> 00:24:56,622
Bahari itakuja na barafu nyeupe nyingi.

444
00:24:56,645 --> 00:24:59,279
Barafu nyeupe?

445
00:24:59,302 --> 00:25:01,272
Ndiyo.

446
00:25:01,295 --> 00:25:04,030
Inatoka baharini kaskazini mbali.

447
00:25:04,053 --> 00:25:06,488
Ina ajabu!

448
00:25:06,512 --> 00:25:10,078
Kuna wanyama juu ya barafu?

449
00:25:10,101 --> 00:25:11,968
Ndiyo.

450
00:25:11,991 --> 00:25:17,124
Kuna ndege weupe na sili juu ya barafu.

451
00:25:17,147 --> 00:25:20,681
Je, unaweza kuona barafu hiyo kutoka melini?

452
00:25:20,704 --> 00:25:22,353
Ndiyo.

453
00:25:22,376 --> 00:25:26,450
Tutakwenda karibu na barafu kwa meli.

454
00:25:26,474 --> 00:25:29,341
Inaonekana kuwa ya kufurahisha!

455
00:25:29,364 --> 00:25:32,617
Ni maarufu sana huko.

456
00:25:32,640 --> 00:25:36,207
Natamani siku moja nione Shiretoko.

457
00:25:36,230 --> 00:25:38,110
Sawa!

458
00:25:38,134 --> 00:25:41,471
Kuna chakula kitamu pia!

459
00:25:41,494 --> 00:25:43,788
Ni nini kitamu?

460
00:25:43,811 --> 00:25:48,745
Samaki wa baharini na kaa ni tamu sana.

461
00:25:48,768 --> 00:25:50,426
Ninapenda kula!

462
00:25:50,449 --> 00:25:52,920
Unafika huko vipi?

463
00:25:52,944 --> 00:25:57,477
Toka Tokyo, unaenda Hokkaido kwa ndege.

464
00:25:57,500 --> 00:26:00,434
Kisha unaingia basi?

465
00:26:00,457 --> 00:26:02,072
Ndiyo.

466
00:26:02,095 --> 00:26:05,065
Nenda Shiretoko kwa basi.

467
00:26:05,089 --> 00:26:07,455
Ni mbali kidogo.

468
00:26:07,478 --> 00:26:11,812
Ni mbali, lakini nataka kwenda siku moja.

469
00:26:11,834 --> 00:26:14,568
Siku moja tutaenda pamoja!

470
00:26:14,591 --> 00:26:16,157
Ndiyo.

471
00:26:16,180 --> 00:26:20,314
Hii ndiyo mwisho wa somo la Urithi wa Dunia wa Japani.

472
00:26:20,337 --> 00:26:24,103
Tumeunda mipango mingi ya safari!

473
00:26:24,126 --> 00:26:27,693
Natamani siku moja nione maeneo yote!